# TypeScript

- `strict` and `noUncheckedIndexedAccess` stay on.
- No `any`. Narrow at boundaries with Zod.
- Branded IDs and closed unions live in `@riddlr/domain`.
- `verbatimModuleSyntax`: use `import type` for types.
- ESM only. NodeNext module resolution.
